  "notes": [
    "**Conocer** is an -ER verb with irregular \"yo\" form in present",
    "Present: irregular \"yo\" form (conozco) with spelling change c→zc before o",
    "Preterite: regular -ER endings",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: regular past participle **conocido**",
    "Future: regular future endings attached to infinitive",
    "Condicional: regular conditional endings attached to infinitive",
    "Used for knowing people/places (familiarity), not facts",
    "In preterite, often means \"to meet (for the first time)\": *La conocí ayer* (I met her yesterday)",
    "Don't confuse with **saber** (to know facts/information)",
    "Common usage: *Conozco a María* (I know María), *Conocí París* (I visited/got to know Paris)",
    "Same conjugation pattern as **parecer**, **crecer**, **ofrecer**, and **desaparecer**"
  ],
